xs-st-prim-sh G A df GX B T HB n o (fqcall z0 z1) env d e s hk h ih = unit
xs-st-prim-sh G A df GX B T HB n o (fqloop z0 z1) env d e s hk h ih = unit
xs-st-prim-sh G A df GX B T HB n o fqnil env d e s hk h ih = unit
